  id: tutorial_gamestart
  title: Welcome to Code and Cultivate!
  body: 'In a world run by code, it''s your job to help the farmer cultivate a humble
    farm into a crop kingdom.


    - Use WASD to move the camera around.

    -
    Use the scroll wheel to zoom the camera in and out.

    - Press "Show Code"
    on the bottom left to see the Coding Panel.


    Now that you know the basic
    controls, press OK to continue.'
